cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the models it implements, please cite the paper below."
title: "renewable-energy-mdp: socially-equitable renewable energy budget allocation MDPs"
abstract: >-
  Python reference implementation of two Markov Decision Process formulations for
  socially-equitable renewable energy budget allocation — a U.S. single-planner
  build model and a West Java (Indonesia) incentive/quota model — evaluated with a
  single problem-agnostic solver interface.
